{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>TextMender 是一款把貼上文字快速整理的工作台，可處理複製得來的清單、筆記與零散片段；無需註冊帳戶，文字只留在自己的裝置上。它適合經常整理文字資料的辦公用戶與學生，現由原價 US $0.99 <a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-194.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>貼上文字即時整理</h2>\n<p>TextMender 以貼上文字為起點，整理零散清單、筆記與複製片段。可修剪多餘空白、刪除空行、去除重複項目、排序、統一 CSV 間距、轉換大小寫，亦能把每行改成 Markdown 項目符號。完成後可直接複製或分享，適合發送訊息、整理筆記或準備檢查清單前使用。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-157-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-158-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-159-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-160-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：TextMender</li><li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/textmender/id6771419902?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T22:11:40.375380+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":293,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T21:56:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T17:19:04.722448+00:00",